# Golden encoding of the synthetic .mptr replay built by synthetic_replay(true) in
# tests/unit/test_replay.cpp (P1-05, ADR 0006 and its P1-05 amendment). Hex bytes, 32 per line.
# Pins the format byte for byte on every CI OS. It embeds a synthetic 12-byte save image,
# so it is not a valid committed fixture; that is why it is hex text, not a .mptr file.
# Regenerate only for an intended format change: the test writes the new bytes to
# <temp>/replay_v0_synthetic.mptr.hex.actual on a mismatch.
